{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54970","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 七十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 七十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，鷄雁（京本作「鹰鹞」）入其中。\n必（京本作「的」）有外（京本作「内」）奸通敌事（京本作「外敌」），忽然搦鸟更爲（京本作「尤」）凶，遇战岂成（京本作「我无」）功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}